.TH stralloc_equalb 3
.SH NAME
stralloc_equalb \- check if stralloc equals a buffer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "stralloc.h"
.PP
.BI "size_t stralloc_equalb(const stralloc *" sa ", const void *" d ", unsigned int " dlen ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B stralloc_equalb
returns 1 if the contents of
.I sa
exactly match the buffer
.I d
of length
.IR dlen ,
and 0 otherwise.